nrf_hw_models (rev 158b9710): model the RTC TICK event. The model does not generate it ("The TICK functionality is not
modelled"), but the time sync library clears a TIMER on every RTC tick to get its sub-tick resolution. Applied by
common.sh (bsim_fetch) to the fetched copy of the models.

diff --git a/src/HW_models/NHW_RTC.c b/src/HW_models/NHW_RTC.c
